X: 1
T: Riverwoods
T:When Kathy Hieatt and I got married I gained a father-in-law, Dick Forscher.  For
T:decades, Dick had been calling dances in Connecticut.  He and his wife, Louise, finally
T:moved north to a beautiful retirement community called Riverwoods where he continued to
T:dance, maintaining a spry, humorous out look on life, till the end.  I wrote this tune
T:on a visit, after walking along the icy river and thinking how much we miss Dick.
C: Jody Kruskal © 2005
Z: played at R&O XXIX
